<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 02:05:29 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>旧金山一名“科技恶作剧者”在同一条街上订购了 50 辆 Waymos，暴露了机器人出租车的网络/安全气囊问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/a-san-francisco-tech-prankster-got-50-waymos-ordered-onto-the-same-street-exposing-robotaxis-cyber-airbag-problem/</link><description>加州要求自动驾驶汽车制造商证明他们可以安全地监控、更新和维护车队，同时遵守网络法。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2250807489-e1786646430687.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 19:45:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/a-san-francisco-tech-prankster-got-50-waymos-ordered-onto-the-same-street-exposing-robotaxis-cyber-airbag-problem/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的关税削减了就业和工资增长。现在，公司正在筹集 1000 亿美元的退款来补充工人的退休金</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/tariff-refunds-employee-bonuses-retirement-funds-williams-sonoma-tjx/</link><description>Williams Sonoma 和 TJX 计划通过 401(k) 付款和奖金向员工返还数百万美元的关税退款。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2285232675-e1789496830521.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 18:44:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/tariff-refunds-employee-bonuses-retirement-funds-williams-sonoma-tjx/</guid></item><item><title>随着人工智能“存在”风险的讨论成为主流，对人工智能监管的推动力不断增强。但特朗普拒绝了经济放缓的呼吁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/push-for-ai-regulation-mounts-as-talk-of-ais-existential-risks-go-mainstream-but-trump-resists-calls-for-a-slowdown/</link><description>上周，对人工智能“杀死所有人类”的担忧成为主流话题。但这场辩论的结果还远不清楚。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2280291162_7519cb-e1789502966344.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 21:09:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/push-for-ai-regulation-mounts-as-talk-of-ais-existential-risks-go-mainstream-but-trump-resists-calls-for-a-slowdown/</guid></item><item><title>在下周的会议之前，特朗普和习近平对 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 关于人工智能放缓的紧急呼吁置若罔闻</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/ai-slowdown-agenda-trump-xi-jinping-meeting/</link><description>Anthropic 和 OpenAI 的首席执行官表示，两国必须加快技术发展以保护人类，但这两位领导人似乎对此不感兴趣，甚至可能是敌对的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2275540800.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 21:59:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/ai-slowdown-agenda-trump-xi-jinping-meeting/</guid></item><item><title>Kate Dohaney 表示人工智能需要不同类型的领导力——“我不是一个坐在后面说削减、削减、削减的首席执行官”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/kate-dohaney-giffgaff-virgin-media-group-ai-demands/</link><description>公司领导者如何应对人工智能浪潮，并带领他们的同事一起应对，是企业高管在展望未来一年时最重要的问题之一。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Kate-Dohaney-pic-1-e1789414853263.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 07:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/kate-dohaney-giffgaff-virgin-media-group-ai-demands/</guid></item><item><title>“让美国人民对人工智能的发展有发言权”：OpenAI 最不受欢迎的纽约政客看到了一个机会</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/alex-bores-who-decides-ai-policy-democratic-party/</link><description>亚历克斯·博雷斯（Alex Bores）告诉《财富》杂志，奥弗顿之窗是敞开的：“即使是被问到的问题也是可以争夺的。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2278315098-e1789492873957.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 20:00:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/alex-bores-who-decides-ai-policy-democratic-party/</guid></item><item><title>世界首富埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 表示，他住在 Airstream 拖车里，负责监督 xAI 迄今为止最大规模的扩张</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/elon-musk-airstream-trailer-memphis-xai-colossus-data-center-sleeping-factory-floor-twitter-tesla-production-hell/</link><description>马斯克表示，他现在住在 xAI 的孟菲斯数据中心，延续了长期以来在工作地点睡觉的习惯。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1228322113-1-e1789497973446.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 19:08:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/elon-musk-airstream-trailer-memphis-xai-colossus-data-center-sleeping-factory-floor-twitter-tesla-production-hell/</guid></item><item><title>《财富》杂志对 2025 年最佳 MBA 课程进行了排名：数据显示如下</title><link>https://fortune.com/education/articles/best-mba-programs-news-analysis/</link><description>哈佛大学、芝加哥布斯商学院和西北凯洛格商学院在《财富》2025 年 MBA 排名中名列前茅，但数据重点介绍了您可能想要考虑的项目。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Best-MBA-programs-2025-map.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 10 Sep 2024 20:14:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/education/articles/best-mba-programs-news-analysis/</guid></item><item><title>Sam Altman 表示 OpenAI 的 IPO 窗口已推迟至 2027 年，但市场并不是罪魁祸首</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/sam-altman-says-openai-ipo-window-pushed-2027-but-markets-arent-the-culprit/</link><description>奥特曼称现在是“不明智的上市时机”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2287521404-e1789173294554.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 10:59:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/sam-altman-says-openai-ipo-window-pushed-2027-but-markets-arent-the-culprit/</guid></item><item><title>职业体育将迎来缩水：自 2015 年以来，观看 NFL 比赛的费用上涨了 28.6%，观看比赛的费用上涨了 72%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/shrinkflation-sports-nfl-cost-fan/</link><description>要观看本赛季的所有足球比赛，您需要花更少的钱花更多的钱。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295130200-e1789487907707.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 16:37:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/shrinkflation-sports-nfl-cost-fan/</guid></item></channel></rss>